('APX-C-3610', '3610', 'SUBJECTS: White Cat in Pink Taekwondo Uniform (Clean →', 'SUBJECTS: White cat in pink taekwondo uniform (clean → progressively wrecked, calm → lethal cool). Sleazy hyena in black suit & shades. Hyena gang (beige tees, black shorts, shades). Grey cat lady in extravagant fur coat (dramatic, high-society energy). Rabbit doorman (hyper-professional).', 15, null, 'https://x.com/drjoetw/status/2047671653698797987', 'FORMAT: 15s / 148 BPM / ONE CONTINUOUS SHOT / stylized 3D action-comedy homage
SUBJECTS: White cat in pink taekwondo uniform (clean → progressively wrecked, calm → lethal cool). Sleazy hyena in black suit & shades. Hyena gang (beige tees, black shorts, shades). Grey cat lady in extravagant fur coat (dramatic, high-society energy). Rabbit doorman (hyper-professional). Elastic animation, exaggerated impacts, gravity-bending stunt physics.
PROPS: Snowfall, rooftop door, narrow stair rails, marble lobby floor, chandelier glow, oversized fur coat.
