('APX-C-3614', '3614', 'Ultra-cinematic 15-Second Rally Car Race through a Rugged', 'Ultra-cinematic 15-second rally car race through a rugged mountain dirt road during golden hour, dust and gravel dominating the scene. Wide aerial shot — rally car speeds along a winding dirt road carved into the mountains, dust trail stretching far behind.', 15, '16:9', 'https://x.com/LudovicCreator/status/2047601464856523121', 'Ultra-cinematic 15-second rally car race through a rugged mountain dirt road during golden hour, dust and gravel dominating the scene.

