('APX-C-3527', '3527', '[Style] Urban Women''s Portrait Film', '[Style] Urban Women''s Portrait Film, Cinematic Color Grading, Moody Luxury, HD, 3 people featured.\n[Duration] 15 seconds\n[Scene] Late-night city — nightclub backstage, apartment bedroom, office.\n[Characters]\nFemale A @Image1 (Black long hair, black leather slip dress + white fur coat, gold hoop…', 15, null, 'https://x.com/johnAGI168/status/2046960424445251887', '[Style] Urban Women''s Portrait Film, Cinematic Color Grading, Photorealistic, Moody Luxury, 4K HD, 3 people featured.\n[Duration] 15 seconds\n[Scene] Late-night city — nightclub backstage, apartment bedroom, office.\n[Characters]\nFemale A @Image1 (Black long hair, black leather slip dress + white fur coat, gold hoop earrings, gold necklace, sunglasses on head, cold and glamorous aura)\nFemale B @Image2 (Orange-red long curly hair, white oversized lazy sweater, pearl necklace, gentle and quiet)\nFemale C @Image3 (Black long straight hair, white shirt + black tie + black skirt, gold earrings, red-rimmed eyes, patient and stubborn)\n\n[00:00-00:02] Shot 1: Nightclub Queen (Slow-mo Entrance)\n[Japanese Narration] Low female voice: ''In the night of this city, three stories are breathing.''\nSlow-mo Medium Shot: Dim nightclub backstage, newspaper-plastered walls, tungsten bulbs casting warm, harsh light. Female A with one hand on hip, fur sliding from shoulder to elbow, tilts her head slightly, glancing at the camera over her sunglasses with a cold smirk. Gold earrings sway with her head movement, reflecting tiny points of light.\n\n[00:02-00:06] Shot 2: Late-night Solitude (Intimate Moment)\n[Japanese Narration]: ''One person hides a face they show to no one.''\nMedium Close-up Side Shot: Warm lamp light interlaced with cold blue moonlight from outside. Female B sits on the edge of the bed, one hand gently clutching the sweater collar, orange-red long hair falling over shoulders and chest, she looks down with eyes slightly closed, eyelashes casting shadows. Pearl necklace glows slightly at the collarbone. City lights outside the window blur into bokeh.\n\n[00:06-00:10] Shot 3: Office Breaking Point\n[Japanese Narration]: ''One person is not even allowed to cry.''\nFrontal Medium Shot Slow Dolly In: A cold white fluorescent-lit office, empty after work. Female C leans against the desk, hands clenched at her sides, knuckles white. The camera slowly pushes toward her face — eyes red, tears welling but held back, lips trembling slightly, jaw tight. The tie is pulled loose, shirt collar slightly open.\n\n[00:10-00:13] Shot 4: Triple Cross-Cut (Rapid Cross-Cut)\n[Japanese Narration]: ''Even so—''\nJump Cut alternating three sets of images: \nFemale A suddenly turns and pushes open the nightclub door into the night, fur fluttering in the wind—\nFemale B looks up at the moonlight outside, expression turning from gentle to firm—\nFemale C wipes a tear from the corner of her eye with the back of her hand, takes a deep breath and straightens her back—\nEach image 1 second, rhythm accelerating with low-frequency drum beats.\n\n[00:13-00:15] Shot 5: Final Frame\n[Japanese Narration]: ''They do not stop.''\nTriple Split Screen: Left - Female A walking backlit on the street; Middle - Female B standing by the window in profile; Right - Female C in the elevator looking straight into the lens. All three freeze simultaneously.\nBlack screen, white Japanese handwritten subtitles appear: ''Three nights, three kinds of strength.''', null, null, 'missing', 4, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'photoreal', 'cold-blue', 'high-fps-slowmo', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: fashion, photoreal', 'seedance_2.0', '@johnAGI168', 'https://x.com/johnAGI168', null, null),
