('APX-C-3476', '3476', 'Humorous Lion Grooming Transformation Video', 'A humorous lion grooming transformation video featuring an black lion inside a luxury animal styling studio. The tone is polished and premium but subtly ridiculous, like high-end salon content made for viral pet entertainment.', null, null, 'https://x.com/ertanlabs/status/2046630039043940613', 'Concept: A humorous lion grooming transformation video featuring an ultra-realistic black lion inside a luxury animal styling studio. The tone is polished and premium but subtly ridiculous, like high-end salon content made for viral pet entertainment. Environment: An elegant boutique grooming lounge with matte black counters, warm vanity bulbs, soft mirror reflections, polished metal tools, and a clean editorial backdrop. The room feels upscale and cinematic rather than like a standard pet salon. A soft beauty-ring glow wraps around the subject, creating glossy highlights on the lion’s fur and tools. Main Subject: A hyper-realistic black lion with deep charcoal fur, a dense textured mane, powerful facial structure, expressive amber eyes, and extremely detailed whiskers. The lion wears a rich dark emerald grooming cape fastened around the neck. Its mane is being transformed into an intentionally comedic but perfectly executed rounded blunt bowl-cut style with an absurdly neat salon finish. Visual Language: Macro beauty shots, ultra-detailed close-ups, alternating between frontal portrait view, side profile, and overhead grooming angles. Shallow depth of field, clean focus pulls, precise autofocus tracking on the lion’s eyes, mane texture, scissors, and comb. Realistic salon tools include a metal comb, mist spray bottle, professional shears, thinning scissors, and a handheld dryer. Look and Feel: Bright luxury lighting, crisp clean aesthetic, tactile fur detail, premium grooming-commercial energy mixed with comedy. The overall style should feel realistic, pristine, and oddly satisfying, with a subtle ASMR grooming mood. 4K, ultra-detailed, sharp texture rendering, believable salon atmosphere. Sequence: Opening: The black lion sits calmly in the styling chair wearing the emerald cape, mane slightly overgrown, fluffy, and uneven. A human groomer’s hand enters frame and slowly lifts the messy mane with a fine comb, brushing upward through the thick fur. The strands separate naturally with soft rustling and tactile movement. Transition. Moistening Pass: From the side angle, a delicate mist is sprayed across the top and front of the lion’s mane. Tiny droplets catch the light. The thick black fur darkens, clumps slightly, and settles into a sleek damp texture as the lion remains still and dignified. Transition. Structural Cut: Overhead angle. A comb lifts a section of the damp mane, and sharp professional scissors remove the excess in one clean, deliberate line. The trim feels precise and intentional, with crisp satisfying snips and visible chunks of dark fur falling away. Transition. Softening the Shape: Front-facing close-up. Thinning shears work quickly across the front edge and sides of the mane, subtly softening the heavy cut. The movement is fast and delicate, producing a rapid series of light salon snips while the lion stares forward with regal seriousness. Transition. Blow-Dry: Side profile. Warm air from a dryer pushes through the dark fur, making it billow and expand into the finished bowl shape. The strands dance in the airflow. Closing: The final perfectly round bowl-cut mane is revealed. The lion looks directly into the lens with a stoic, kingly expression. Screen fades to black.', null, null, 'missing', 6, 'keep', 'pass', 'direct', 'photoreal', 'warm-amber', '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: commercial, fashion, music, venue', 'seedance_2.0', '@ertanlabs', 'https://x.com/ertanlabs', null, null),
('APX-C-3469', '3469', 'Blonde/orange Cat Naps on the Couch', 'A blonde/orange cat naps on the couch. The robot vacuum bumps into the couch leg. The cat looks down. Annoyed. The cat drops a paw and pushes the vacuum away. It spins, recalculates, comes right back. Bumps the couch again. The cat jumps down. Sits directly on top of it. The vacuum tries to move.', 12, null, 'https://x.com/SPEEDAI07/status/2046628404930412609', '[0-2s] A blonde/orange cat naps on the couch. The robot vacuum bumps into the couch leg. The cat looks down. Annoyed.
[2-4s] The cat drops a paw and pushes the vacuum away. It spins, recalculates, comes right back. Bumps the couch again.
[4-6s] The cat jumps down. Sits directly on top of it. The vacuum tries to move. Can''t. Wheels spinning. Going nowhere.
[6-8s] The vacuum reverses hard. The cat slides off the back. Lands on its butt. Dignity gone.
[8-10s] The cat chases it. The vacuum dodges around a chair leg. Then another. The cat crashes into the chair.
[10-12s] The cat sits in the corner licking its paw pretending nothing happened. The vacuum bumps into it one more time. On purpose.

The cat stalks the vacuum across the room. Low. Predator mode. The vacuum is heading for the kitchen. 
In the kitchen, vacuum wants to get on the dock and cat knows it. The cat jumps down. Sits right in front of the dock. 
The vacuum tries left. The cat slides left. Tries right. The cat slides right. No way through.
a woman enters the kitchen and says "oh dear, it''s running out of battery" and asks the cat to "get out of the way" so vacuum can enter dock. she places the vacuum and says "let him do his job"
Click. The vacuum docks. Light turns green. The cat looks at it with anger and throws a paw, the vacuum responds with a beep.', null, null, 'missing', 6, 'keep', 'pass', 'direct', 'stylized-real', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: kitchen', 'seedance_2.0', '@SPEEDAI07', 'https://x.com/SPEEDAI07', null, null),
