('APX-C-3438', '3438', 'Sequence Set on a Crowded Istanbul Sidewalk at Dusk', 'A cinematic 15-second sequence set on a crowded Istanbul sidewalk at dusk, with warm amber streetlights, glowing shop windows, and dense pedestrian movement in both directions. The main character is a calm, mysterious woman (use <<<image1>>> as strict identity reference with full face consistency).', 15, null, 'https://x.com/kingofdairyque/status/2046416090688045564', 'A cinematic 15-second sequence set on a crowded Istanbul sidewalk at dusk, with warm amber streetlights, glowing shop windows, and dense pedestrian movement in both directions. The main character is a calm, mysterious woman (use <<<image_1>>> as strict identity reference with full face consistency). She walks steadily toward the camera through the crowd, her presence subtle yet powerful. As she passes a young man, she gently places her hand on his shoulder; at the exact moment of contact, his hair rapidly turns white, deep wrinkles form across his face, his posture collapses, and he ages decades within seconds before dropping to his knees. She withdraws her hand as visible golden time-energy flows up her arm, her posture becoming more refined and dominant, and she continues walking without looking back. Moving forward through the crowd, she brushes her fingers across the arm of another passerby, a woman who instantly begins to decay—her skin turns grey, her motion freezes, and her body slowly disintegrates into fine dust carried away by the wind. A pulse of glowing golden energy transfers from the dust into the main character’s chest, her eyes briefly illuminating with a soft amber glow as the air around her shimmers with subtle time distortion like heat haze. Nearby pedestrians react with fear, stepping away and clearing space around her. As the sequence reaches its final moment, she stops in the center of the now-empty sidewalk, golden energy swirling around her entire body in visible streams. She slowly raises both hands and opens her palms, releasing the accumulated time-energy upward into a massive vertical beam of radiant golden light that shoots into the darkening sky, illuminating the entire street. Her hair and coat lift dramatically in the surge of power before the light fades away. The glow disappears, leaving the street completely empty—every pedestrian gone. She calmly lowers her hands, places them in her pockets, and walks away alone into the amber-lit dusk. Shot in cinematic steadicam style with shallow depth of field, volumetric golden lighting, photorealistic VFX, ultra-detailed textures, Dolby Vision grade, smooth 60fps motion, and full 8K quality.', null, null, 'missing', 5, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'photoreal', 'warm-amber', '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: photoreal', 'seedance_2.0', '@kingofdairyque', 'https://x.com/kingofdairyque', null, null),
