('APX-C-3423', '3423', 'Ultra-low Front Tracking Shot Inches above Asphalt', 'Ultra-low front tracking shot inches above asphalt, a high-performance sports car already at full speed blasting through a tight urban street, suspension compressed, reflections streaking across glossy body panels, extreme motion blur on surroundings, no buildup, immediate velocity, cinematic…', null, null, 'https://x.com/kingofdairyque/status/2046145116751224872', 'SHOT 01 Ultra-low front tracking shot inches above asphalt, a high-performance sports car already at full speed blasting through a tight urban street, suspension compressed, reflections streaking across glossy body panels, extreme motion blur on surroundings, no buildup, immediate velocity, hyper-realistic, cinematic, 8k detail. SHOT 02 Side close tracking shot as the car threads between parked vehicles at high speed, speed maintained, tight urban environment, photorealistic, intense motion. SHOT 03 First-person FPV drone aggressively chasing directly behind the car, locked onto rear bumper, rapid swerves through traffic, slight camera instability, extreme speed sensation, kinetic, photorealistic. SHOT 04 Extreme close-up on front wheel during hard braking into a corner, ABS pulsing rapidly, tire briefly losing and regaining grip, subtle instability, rubber deformation visible, asphalt texture sharp, hyper-detailed, realistic physics. SHOT 05 Front 3/4 angle as the car exits the turn, driver overcorrects steering, rear stepping out wider than intended, uneven weight transfer, tires struggling for grip, tension rising, near loss of control. SHOT 06 Rear tracking shot as the car transitions into a deep uncontrolled slide, rotation increasing, tires fully slipping, appearing on the edge of spinning out, smoke beginning to form, maximum instability. SHOT 07 Same motion continued, but the driver countersteers precisely at the last moment, front wheels snapping into alignment, grip suddenly returning, the slide stabilizing just before full spin, razor-thin recovery, physically realistic. SHOT 08 Side tracking shot as the car shoots out of the drift with regained traction, tires gripping hard, smoke trailing behind, acceleration surging forward, control re-established under extreme force. SHOT 09 Ultra-low tracking shot again, even faster now, the car blasting past the camera with inches to spare, air displacement and motion blur overwhelming the frame, pure speed dominance. SHOT 10 Wide shot of the street ahead as the car disappears into the distance, leaving faint tire smoke and echoes of motion, environment settling, tension released without impact.', null, null, 'missing', 5, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'photoreal', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: photoreal', 'seedance_2.0', '@kingofdairyque', 'https://x.com/kingofdairyque', null, null),
('APX-C-3409', '3409', 'Showgirl in Torn Silk Stockings and Feathered Headdress', 'A showgirl in torn silk stockings and feathered headdress crouches behind the bar, clutching a satchel, eyes darting toward the back door.', 15, null, 'https://x.com/GlitterPixely/status/2046129490074415230', '0-3s: A showgirl in torn silk stockings and feathered headdress crouches behind the bar, clutching a satchel, eyes darting toward the back door. 3-7s: She makes a run for it across the sawdust floor, passing drunken cowboys who reach for her but miss by inches, her sequins catching the light like scattered diamonds. 7-12s: The bouncer in a brocade vest lunges from the shadows, she slides under his grasp on her knees, knocking over a whiskey tray that arcs through the air. 12-15s: She bursts through the back door into a rainy alley, breath visible in cold air, as the piano inside hits a dramatic final chord. Tracking shot following her movement, subtle handheld shake for urgency. Midnight blue and warm interior light contrast, rain-slicked cobblestones, gaslight halos, noir-Western hybrid aesthetic. 4K, determined expression stable, fluid motion, sequin detail preserved, atmospheric haze.', null, null, 'missing', 4, 'keep', 'pass', 'direct', 'stylized-real', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: venue, handheld', 'seedance_2.0', '@GlitterPixely', 'https://x.com/GlitterPixely', null, null)
