('APX-S-3610-2', 'APX-C-3610', 2, null, null, null, 'ENVIRONMENT: Snowy rooftop → claustrophobic stairwell → grand luxury lobby → snowy city street. MOOD: Stylish absurd combat, dry punchline humor, elegant chaos escalating nonstop. COLOR FLOW: Cold blue → sickly green stairwell → golden luxury → crisp winter white. CAMERA: Single unbroken Steadicam, aggressive tracking, whip pans, spins, vertical drops, always orbiting the white cat. Wide 24mm feel. SCENE: 1. Snow drifts. White cat stands still, centered, unbothered. A hyena slides into frame: “Hey… you look expensive.” 2.', null, null, 'ENVIRONMENT: Snowy rooftop → claustrophobic stairwell → grand luxury lobby → snowy city street. MOOD: Stylish absurd combat, dry punchline humor, elegant chaos escalating nonstop.', 'animal-character', 'sliding', null, null, 'rooftop, city street', 'comedic'),
('APX-S-3610-3', 'APX-C-3610', 3, null, null, null, 'She doesn’t blink. Turns. Walks. Dead silence. Hyena mutters: “Wow. Cold.” 3. Door BURSTS open—gang floods in, instantly surrounding her. “Wrong floor, sweetheart.” 4. Motion detonates—chain punches snap like gunfire. Camera punches in with each strike. Faces warp, bodies jolt backward. 5. Wrist trap → pivot → wall slam. Elbow strike lands sharp. Low sweep drops two at once. Camera whips around to catch impact. 6. She advances into stairwell. Tight brutal exchanges. One enemy lifted and hurled down the stairs, triggering chaotic domino crashes.', null, null, 'Door BURSTS open—gang floods, instantly surrounding her. She advances into stairwell.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3610-4', 'APX-C-3610', 4, null, null, null, '7. Two rush together. She slips between them, hooks both necks, synchronized leg sweep—both slam and tumble violently. One groans: “I quit…” 8. Camera spirals downward. She grabs railing and slides fast, delivering precise kicks mid-glide like target hits. “I hate this job!” 9. Launch off railing—brief slow-motion flip, fabric trailing—then instant snap back to full speed on landing. 10. Lobby impact. Marble echoes. She lands composed. Elegant crowd freezes, staring at her now scuffed uniform.', null, null, 'She slips between them, hooks both necks, synchronized leg sweep—both slam and tumble violently. She grabs railing and slides fast, delivering precise kicks mid-glide like target hits.', null, 'sliding; flipping', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3610-5', 'APX-C-3610', 5, null, null, null, '11. A beat of silence. Her eyes shift, locking onto the fur coat. 12. Sudden burst—she dashes, snatches coat mid-run, spins and wears it flawlessly in one fluid motion. 13. Grey cat lady shouts, “HEY—what are you—?!” then panics, covering herself: “Absolutely not!” 14. Hyenas crash into the lobby behind in a tangled pile. Rabbit doorman already opens the door with perfect timing. 15. Snowy street. She steps out, now regal and untouchable. Walks toward camera with a slight smirk: “Relax.', null, null, 'Her eyes shift, locking onto the fur coat. Sudden burst—she dashes, snatches coat mid-run, spins and wears it flawlessly in one fluid motion. She steps out, now regal and untouchable.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3610-6', 'APX-C-3610', 6, null, null, null, 'I’m classy.” SFX: Sharp winter wind, door blast, rapid strike impacts, heavy body thuds, stairwell echoes, railing grind, slow-motion air whoosh, marble impact boom, crowd gasp wave, fabric whip snap, chaotic crash pile, door swing gust,', null, null, 'I’m classy.” SFX: Sharp winter wind, door blast, rapid strike impacts, heavy body thuds, stairwell echoes, railing grind, air whoosh, marble impact boom, crowd gasp wave, fabric whip snap, chaotic crash pile, door swing gust.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
