('APX-S-3471-1', 'APX-C-3471', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 231, 'Locked camera ground level shot, 15 seconds. The Bow Bridge in Central Park, New York City — same fixed angle, same framing, all 12 months of the year cycling through in one continuous timelapse.', null, null, null, null, 'bridge, park, new york', null),
('APX-S-3460-1', 'APX-C-3460', 1, null, null, null, 'Street performance: a vibrant parrot performs basketball tricks before a lively crowd on a sunlit paved street. Bright daylight, colorful feathers contrast with the orange ball, shallow depth of field, blue sky. Camera: ultra-low ground-level, handheld documentary feel, smooth pans/tilts tracking movement, making the bird feel larger than life.', null, null, 'Street performance: a vibrant parrot performs basketball tricks before a lively crowd on a sunlit paved street. Bright daylight, colorful feathers contrast with the orange ball, blue sky.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3460-2', 'APX-C-3460', 2, null, null, null, null, 350, 313, 'Action + Sound: Parrot balances ball on its back (crowd murmurs) → rolls into headstand, flips ball to feet (gasps) → kicks it high while flipping upright (whoosh, cheers) → catches and balances it on head (applause builds) → walks…', null, 'flipping', null, null, null, 'playful'),
('APX-S-3442-1', 'APX-C-3442', 1, null, null, null, 'A passenger inside a train, gripping tightly, eyes wide. A massive creature slams into the side of the train, derailing it violently. High-speed train crossing open landscape, debris flying instantly. Handheld tracking shot inside the train, camera thrown sideways on impact, glass shattering and chaos erupting.', null, null, 'A passenger inside a train, gripping tightly, eyes wide. A massive creature slams into the side of the train, derailing it violently. High-speed train crossing open landscape, debris flying instantly.', null, null, null, null, 'train', null),
('APX-S-3438-1', 'APX-C-3438', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 390, 'She walks steadily toward the camera through the crowd, her presence subtle yet powerful.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-3438-2', 'APX-C-3438', 2, null, null, null, null, 392, 423, 'As she passes a young man, she gently places her hand on his shoulder; at the exact moment of contact, his hair rapidly turns white, deep wrinkles form across his face, his posture collapses, and he ages decades within seconds before…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3438-3', 'APX-C-3438', 3, null, null, null, null, 816, 465, 'Moving forward through the crowd, she brushes her fingers across the arm of another passerby, a woman who instantly begins to decay—her skin turns grey, her motion freezes, and her body slowly disintegrates into fine dust carried away by…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3438-4', 'APX-C-3438', 4, null, null, null, null, 1282, 455, 'Nearby pedestrians react with fear, stepping away and clearing space around her. As the sequence reaches its final moment, she stops in the center of the now-empty sidewalk, golden energy swirling around her entire body in visible streams.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3438-5', 'APX-C-3438', 5, null, null, null, null, 1738, 467, 'Her hair and coat lift dramatically in the surge of power before the light fades away. She calmly lowers her hands, places them in her pockets, and walks away alone into the amber-lit dusk.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3473-1', 'APX-C-3473', 1, null, null, null, '"DEMOLITION COUTURE" Creative Director DNA: Demna. The ugliness that becomes beauty. The street that becomes the runway. The apocalypse as aesthetic. 65mm IMAX. Ultra-wide Panavision — so wide the model appears distorted at the edges, intentionally.', null, null, 'Ultra-wide Panavision — so wide the model appears distorted at the edges, intentionally.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3412-1', 'APX-C-3412', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 566, 'A, high-octane epic set within the heart of an endless, undulating desert of scarlet sand. A colossal Desert Leviathan—a serpentine creature forged from ancient, hardened clay, bone, and pulsating veins of molten obsidian—violently…', null, null, null, null, 'desert', 'epic'),
('APX-S-3412-2', 'APX-C-3412', 2, null, null, null, null, 568, 506, 'Instead of trying to maintain balance, she embraces the creature''s massive upward surge. She uses a golden, scimitar-shaped baton to weave the rising sand columns, drawing shimmering, fractal symbols of golden energy and glowing turquoise…', null, 'plating', null, null, 'waterfall, desert', null),
('APX-S-3412-3', 'APX-C-3412', 3, null, null, null, null, 1075, 662, 'The camera abandons a traditional perspective for a kinetic, fast-paced shot, following the dancer’s flight as she leaps from crystal sand-step to crystal sand-step, navigating the dangerous amethyst terrain and dodging the swarm of metal…', null, 'leaping', null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-3412-4', 'APX-C-3412', 4, null, null, null, null, 1738, 511, 'She dives headfirst toward the creature’s open, frozen maw.', null, null, null, null, 'desert', null),
('APX-S-3412-5', 'APX-C-3412', 5, null, null, null, null, 2250, 391, 'The Shaman’s magic hums with a pulsating, rhythmic chant layered with the crackling of siphoned electricity. When the frost-ravens erupt, the sound shifts to the shrieking, high-pitched scratching of ice on ice.', null, 'driving', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3414-1', 'APX-C-3414', 1, null, null, null, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic action sequence set on a busy New York City street during late afternoon golden hour. The main subject is a confident, powerful woman matching the exact appearance of the reference image (same facial features, hairstyle, proportions, and identity consistency). She is dressed in a sharp, high-fashion formal outfit — a tailored fitted blazer, structured trousers or pencil skirt with a slit for movement, and sleek heels or luxury boots.', null, null, 'She is dressed in a sharp, high-fashion formal outfit — a tailored fitted blazer, structured trousers or pencil skirt with a slit for movement, and sleek heels or luxury boots.', null, null, null, null, 'new york, city street', null),
('APX-S-3414-2', 'APX-C-3414', 2, null, null, null, 'Subtle gold jewelry adds sophistication. Her look blends elegance with strength, like a high-end action film protagonist. She is surrounded by 4–6 men in clean, formal business suits (black, navy, charcoal), creating a strong visual contrast. The fight begins naturally in the middle of a functioning city street. The environment feels fully alive: Yellow taxis driving past Pedestrians walking naturally A few people stopping to watch or record Others continuing their routine, ignoring the chaos The fight choreography is stylish, precise, and controlled: Fast, fluid movements with sharp kicks and clean strikes Graceful dodges and turns, blending agility with power Cinematic slow-motion at key impact moments Hair and outfit reacting naturally to motion Camera work is highly cinematic: Smooth tracking shots following her movement Handheld energy during intense moments Close-ups on expressions, confidence, and impact Wide shots showing contrast between calm city life and action Lighting is natural with cinematic color grading — warm golden highlights, soft shadows, slightly desaturated tones for a premium film look.', null, null, 'Her look blends elegance with strength, like a high-end action film protagonist. She is surrounded by 4–6 men in clean, formal business suits (black, navy, charcoal), creating a strong visual contrast.', null, 'driving', null, null, 'city street', 'intense'),
('APX-S-3414-3', 'APX-C-3414', 3, null, null, null, 'Reflections on cars and glass add realism. She remains composed and dominant throughout — calm, calculated, and in control rather than chaotic. Final Hero Shot: She stands confidently in the middle of the street, adjusting her blazer sleeve or brushing back her hair. The defeated men lie around her. Traffic continues moving behind her as if nothing happened.', null, null, 'She remains composed and dominant throughout — calm, calculated, and in control rather than chaotic. Final Hero Shot: She stands confidently in the middle of the street, adjusting her blazer sleeve or brushing back her hair.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
